Have you played nethack so much that it seems like that you have done
everything under the sun that it is possible to do concerning it? Or maybe
you just want to know how you really compare to those people next to you on
the hi-score list. Well, I had a few spare hours the other day, so the result
is "The Nethack Purity Test". Yeah, I know, I know, if you consider yourself a
nethack purist, or this post to be a complete waste of bandwidth, then feel
free to hit 'n' now, or to answer yes to questions 131-132.

The test is in three sections, and the questions start out normal and tame
and get progressively worse (or better) as the test goes on. The first section
deals with standard achievements ("Have you ever gotten this far"), the
second deals with tales of woe ("Has this ever happened to you"), while the
last section deals with all the devious things that hackers have been known
to occasionally do ("Have you ever done this"). Note that many of the things
I haven't done myself, but I do know of others who have done them, or that at
least that it is possible for them do be done.

(Last chance to hit 'n'. Possible *spoilers* in the questions, of course.)

