################  Section 4:  SCORING  ################

For section 1, add one point to your score for each YES" answer.
For section 2, either subtract or add one point for each YES" answer,
               depending on whether you consider yourself a "purist".
For section 3, either add or subtract one point for each "YES" answer,
               depending on whether you definitely _don't_ consider
               yourself a "purist".

